From: PlezyNG
Subject: [PATCH] Android ANVIL: govern missed frame deadlines

Suppress late synthesized frames, step back to MPV smoothing after a deadline storm, and permit one recovery probe after the cooldown. Report the active governor and cumulative fallback counters through filter metadata.

diff --git a/video/filter/vf_anvil.c b/video/filter/vf_anvil.c
--- a/video/filter/vf_anvil.c
+++ b/video/filter/vf_anvil.c
@@ -2219,6 +2219,14 @@
